<title>USA: Arterial Vascular seeks approval of stents.</title>
<headline>Arterial Vascular seeks approval of stents.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc said Monday it applied to the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for premarket approval of its coronary stent products.</p>
<p>It said, however, that it does not expect FDA approval of the stents before 1998. The company currently sells stent and balloon angioplasty systems for treatment of coronary artery disease in more than 40 countries outside the U.S.</p>
</text>
